needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nThis PR adds basic unit tests for the StreamPeerTLS class, addressing issue #43440.\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n\r\n* Added `test_stream_peer_tls.h` under `tests/core/io/`\r\n* Verified availability of the TLS backend\r\n* Verified that `StreamPeerTLS::create()` returns a valid object\r\n* Added checks for the `StreamPeerTLS` enum values:\r\n\r\n  * `STATUS_DISCONNECTED`\r\n  * `STATUS_HANDSHAKING`\r\n  * `STATUS_CONNECTED`\r\n  * `STATUS_ERROR`\r\n  * `STATUS_ERROR_HOSTNAME_MISMATCH`\r\n* Ensured proper cleanup using `memdelete` to prevent `ObjectDB` leaks\r\n\r\n**Notes:**\r\n\r\n* These tests have been verified to pass locally with the Godot test runner.\r\n* Follows Godot coding and style guidelines.\r\n* The PR is intended to incrementally improve unit test coverage as requested in #43440.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":311852125,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTE4NTIxMjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20work","name":"needs work","description":"","color":"cc9999","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":649800701,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDk4MDA3MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:network","name":"topic:network","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng